<link rel="stylesheet" href="/pricing-rules.css"><section class="pricing-page-head"><p class="eyebrow">One rule, one clear review</p><h1><%= draft?'Edit':'Create' %> a pricing rule</h1><p>Start with the outcome. Review the exact scope before anything becomes active.</p></section>
<form method="post" action="/sales/pricing/rules/proposals" class="card form-card pricing-rules-form"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>">
<% if(draft){ %><input type="hidden" name="ruleId" value="<%= draft.id %>"><input type="hidden" name="expectedRevision" value="<%= draft.version %>"><% } %>
<label class="field">Name<input name="name" required maxlength="160" placeholder="A name your team will understand"></label>
<label class="field">What should this do?<select name="kind" id="pricing-kind"><option value="promotion">Run an offer or discount</option><option value="price_list">Set customer or quantity prices</option><option value="guard">Protect margins and limit discounts</option></select></label>
<label class="field">Currency<input name="currency" value="USD" required pattern="[A-Z]{3}" maxlength="3"></label><label class="field"><input type="checkbox" name="enabled" value="1" checked> Enable after approval</label>
<fieldset data-pricing-kind="promotion"><legend>The offer</legend><label class="field">Discount type<select name="discountType"><option value="percent">Percentage off</option><option value="fixed_order">Fixed amount off the eligible order</option><option value="fixed_unit">Fixed amount off each unit</option><option value="fixed_line">Fixed amount off each eligible line</option><option value="bundle">Bundle price</option></select></label><label class="field">Percentage, amount off, or total bundle price<input name="discountValue" type="number" min="0" step="0.01" value="0"></label><label class="field">Optional discount code<input name="code" maxlength="80"></label>
<details><summary>Bundle products</summary><p>For a bundle, choose every required product and units in one bundle. The amount above is the total bundle price.</p><% for(let index=0;index<5;index++){ %><div><label class="field">Product <%= index+1 %><select name="bundleSku"><option value="">Choose a product</option><% for(const p of products){ %><option value="<%= p.id %>"><%= p.name %> · <%= p.code %></option><% } %></select></label><label class="field">Units<input name="bundleQuantity" type="number" min="1" step="1" value="1"></label></div><% } %></details></fieldset>
<fieldset data-pricing-kind="price_list" hidden disabled><legend>Price tiers</legend><p>Add a product once for each quantity threshold. A higher threshold takes effect when the order reaches it.</p><% for(let index=0;index<8;index++){ %><div><label class="field">Product <%= index+1 %><select name="entrySku"><option value="">Choose a product</option><% for(const p of products){ %><option value="<%= p.id %>"><%= p.name %> · <%= p.code %></option><% } %></select></label><label class="field">From this many units<input name="entryQuantity" type="number" min="1" value="1"></label><label class="field">Price per unit<input name="entryAmount" type="number" min="0" step="0.01"></label></div><% } %></fieldset>
<fieldset data-pricing-kind="guard" hidden disabled><legend>Business safeguards</legend><label class="field">Minimum gross margin %<input name="minimumMargin" type="number" min="0" max="100" step="0.01"></label><label class="field">Maximum discount %<input name="maximumDiscount" type="number" min="0" max="100" step="0.01"></label><p>StockChief stops when a safeguard is exceeded or required cost evidence is missing.</p></fieldset>
<details><summary>Who and what should this apply to?</summary><p>Leave a selection empty to include everyone or every eligible product.</p><label class="field">Customers<select name="customerIds" multiple><% for(const c of customers){ %><option value="<%= c.id %>"><%= c.name %></option><% } %></select></label><label class="field">Products<select name="skuIds" multiple><% for(const p of products){ %><option value="<%= p.id %>"><%= p.name %> · <%= p.code %></option><% } %></select></label><label class="field">Categories<select name="categoryIds" multiple><% for(const category of categories){ %><option><%= category %></option><% } %></select></label></details>
<details><summary>Dates, conditions and combinations</summary><label class="field">Starts at (UTC)<input name="startsAt" type="datetime-local"></label><label class="field">Ends at (UTC)<input name="endsAt" type="datetime-local"></label><label class="field">Priority (higher first)<input name="priority" type="number" value="0" min="-100000" max="100000"></label>
<label class="field">Minimum order amount<input name="minimumOrder" type="number" min="0" step="0.01"></label><label class="field">Minimum units per eligible line<input name="minimumQuantity" type="number" min="1"></label><label class="field">Total uses<input name="maxRedemptions" type="number" min="1"></label><label class="field">Uses per customer<input name="maxPerCustomer" type="number" min="1"></label>
<label class="field">Combining offers<select name="stacking"><option value="exclusive">Use this offer alone</option><option value="stack">Allow stacking in priority order</option></select></label><label class="field">Only one offer from this group<input name="stackGroup"></label><label class="field">Never combine with<select name="excludes" multiple><% for(const r of rules.filter(r=>r.kind==='promotion')){ %><option value="<%= r.id %>"><%= r.name %></option><% } %></select></label></details>
<button class="btn btn--primary" type="submit">Review this rule</button><a href="/sales/pricing">Cancel</a></form>
<% if(draft){ %><script id="pricing-initial" type="application/json"><%- JSON.stringify(draft).replace(/</g,'\\u003c') %></script><% } %><script src="/pricing-rules.js" defer></script>
